<h2 class="mb-3">Who We Are</h2>

<p>
    The Gampola Urban Council Public Library is the hill‑country’s principal knowledge
    hub, proudly serving the multi‑ethnic community of Gampola and its surrounding
    villages since the mid‑20<sup>th</sup> century.  Our Grade I accreditation from the
    National Library &amp; Documentation Services Board reflects both the breadth of our
    collections and the professionalism of our staff.
</p>

<p>
    Today we curate more than <strong>45 000 physical items</strong>—books, newspapers,
    journals and local‐history archives—in Sinhala, Tamil and English, and we have
    embraced modern library science through a fully‑featured digital LMS.
</p>

<p>
    A team of qualified librarians, IT specialists and community volunteers works
    together to keep the doors (and the Wi‑Fi) open seven days a week, fostering an
    inclusive, welcoming space for readers of every age and background.
</p>

<h3 class="fw-semibold mt-5 mb-3">Divisions of the Library</h3>

<div class="accordion" id="divisionAccordion">
    <!-- Lending Division -->
    <div class="accordion-item">
        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingLending">
            <button class="accordion-button collapsed d-flex align-items-center"
                    type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#collapseLending" aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="collapseLending">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-2"></i> Lending Division
            </button>
        </h2>
        <div id="collapseLending" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
             aria-labelledby="headingLending"
             data-bs-parent="#divisionAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>The Lending Division is the heart of our circulation service, enabling members to borrow books, return or renew them, 
                    and manage their borrowing accounts. Equipped with RFID and barcode systems, this division ensures efficient, user-friendly 
                    lending operations, including SMS reminders and overdue tracking</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <br />

    <!-- Research Division -->
    <div class="accordion-item">
        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingResearch">
            <button class="accordion-button collapsed d-flex align-items-center"
                    type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#collapseResearch" aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="collapseResearch">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-2"></i> Research Division
            </button>
        </h2>
        <div id="collapseResearch" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
             aria-labelledby="headingResearch"
             data-bs-parent="#divisionAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>Our Research Division is tailored for students, scholars, and professionals who require access to academic resources, 
                   government publications, and historical records. With quiet study spaces and trained staff to assist with referencing, 
                   it's the go-to spot for focused academic work.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <br />

    <!-- Kids Division -->
    <div class="accordion-item">
        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingKids">
            <button class="accordion-button collapsed d-flex align-items-center"
                    type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#collapseKids" aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="collapseKids">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-2"></i> Kids Division
            </button>
        </h2>
        <div id="collapseKids" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
             aria-labelledby="headingKids"
             data-bs-parent="#divisionAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>The Kids Division offers a welcoming space where children can discover the joy of reading through colorful storybooks, 
                    engaging storytelling sessions, and fun learning activities. It’s designed to nurture curiosity and creativity in early 
                    learners, with special programs during school holidays.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <br />

    <!-- Newspaper Division -->
    <div class="accordion-item">
        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingNews">
            <button class="accordion-button collapsed d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"
                    type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#collapseNews" aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="collapseNews">
                <span class="fw-semibold">Newspaper Reading Division</span>
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg toggle-icon ms-auto"></i>
            </button>
        </h2>
        <div id="collapseNews" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
             aria-labelledby="headingNews" data-bs-parent="#divisionAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>
                    The Newspaper Reading Division provides access to daily newspapers in Sinhala, Tamil, and English. Visitors can stay 
                    informed in a peaceful reading lounge that offers both current and archived editions, making it a favorite spot for 
                    senior readers and news enthusiasts alike.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <br />

    <!-- IT Division -->
    <div class="accordion-item">
        <h2 class="accordion-header" id="headingIT">
            <button class="accordion-button collapsed d-flex align-items-center"
                    type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                    data-bs-target="#collapseIT" aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="collapseIT">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg me-2"></i> IT Division
            </button>
        </h2>
        <div id="collapseIT" class="accordion-collapse collapse"
             aria-labelledby="headingIT"
             data-bs-parent="#divisionAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>The IT Division supports the library’s digital infrastructure, including the Library Management System, public 
                   access computers, Wi-Fi services, and online OPAC access. It also conducts digital literacy workshops and helps 
                   bridge the digital divide in the Gampola region.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>



@section Scripts {
    <script>
        
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
            const accordion = document.getElementById("divisionAccordion");

            accordion.addEventListener("show.bs.collapse", (e) => {
                const icon = e.target
                    .previousElementSibling   
                    .querySelector("i");
                icon.classList.replace("bi-plus-lg", "bi-dash-lg");
            });

            accordion.addEventListener("hide.bs.collapse", (e) => {
                const icon = e.target
                    .previousElementSibling
                    .querySelector("i");
                icon.classList.replace("bi-dash-lg", "bi-plus-lg");
            });
        });
    </script>
}